{"id":"moonlight-flower","name":{"en":"Moonlight Flower","ja":"月光花"},"desc":{"en":"A pure white flower said to bloom only a few days each year. Unless you know when it'll bloom beforehand, you'll probably never see it open up.","ja":"一年の内、決まった数日にしか咲かないとい われる純白の花。事前に咲く日を知っている か、余程運が良くないと出会うことはできな い。その分、当然希少価値も高い。"},"note":"Galaxy rank","level":10,"locations":[{"id":"moonlight-forest","name":{"en":"Moonlight Forest","ja":"月光の森"},"parent":"arland-new-world"}],"traits":{"id":"all-heal","name":{"en":"All Heal","ja":"全ての傷を癒す"}},"categories":[{"id":"healing","name":{"en":"(Healing)","ja":"（薬品）"},"icon":"totori-category-healing"},{"id":"plant","name":{"en":"(Plant)","ja":"（植物類）"},"icon":"totori-category-plant"},{"id":"supplement","name":{"en":"(Supplement)","ja":"（中和剤）"},"icon":"totori-category-supplement"}],"item_type":"Ingredient","index":15}